{"sha": "90910e82bd4518cf745a48a250a0458167cb31c6f8a3a95028e4ca19c0e03bcb", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g6:measure} 章 --- 周长、面积、体积}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:1}", "$3.5$ m $= 350$ cm; \\quad $420$ mm $= 42$ cm; \\quad", "$0.8$ km $= 800$ m; \\quad $25\\,000$ m $= 25$ km.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:2}", "长方形：$2 \\times (8 + 3.5) = 2 \\times 11.5 = 23$ cm。", "正方形：$4 \\times 6.2 = 24.8$ cm。", "三角形：$5 + 7 + 9 = 21$ cm。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:3}", "一圈：$2\\pi \\times 50 = 100\\pi \\approx 314$ m。对于 $2$ km", "$= 2000$ m 时：$2000 \\div 314 \\approx 6.4$，故需要 $7$ 整圈", "（$6$ 圈只能走约 $1\\,885$ m）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:4}", "长方形：$9 \\times 4 = 36$ cm$^2$。正方形：$7^2 = 49$ m$^2$。", "直角三角形：$\\frac{6 \\times 10}{2} = 30$ cm$^2$。", "圆：$\\pi \\times 3^2 = 9\\pi \\approx 28$ cm$^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:5}", "$3$ m$^2 = 30\\,000$ cm$^2$; \\quad", "$45\\,000$ cm$^2 = 4.5$ m$^2$; \\quad", "$2.5$ L $= 2\\,500$ cm$^3$; \\quad", "$4\\,500$ L $= 4.5$ m$^3$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:6}", "围栏（周长）：$2 \\times (120 + 85) = 2 \\times 205 = 410$ m。", "面积：$120 \\times 85 = 10\\,200$ m$^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:7}", "长方体：$5 \\times 4 \\times 10 = 200$ cm$^3$。正方体：", "$3 \\times 3 \\times 3 = 27$ cm$^3$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:8}", "周长 $16$ cm 意味着长 $+$ 宽 $= 8$ cm。例如", "$6 \\times 2$（面积 $12$ cm$^2$）和 $5 \\times 3$（面积 $15$ cm$^2$）", "--- 或者正方形 $4 \\times 4$（面积 $16$ cm$^2$）。越接近", "正方形，面积就越大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:9}", "面积：$10 \\times 2 + 2 \\times 6 = 20 + 12 = 32$ cm$^2$。", "", "周长（竖杆位于横杆正下方中央）：沿着图形走一圈，", "\\[", "10 + 2 + 4 + 6 + 2 + 6 + 4 + 2 = 36 \\text{ cm}", "\\]", "（上边；横杆右端；横杆下侧右边；竖杆右边；竖杆", "底端；竖杆左边；横杆下侧左边；横杆左端）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:10}", "\\emph{1.} $V = 25 \\times 10 \\times 2 = 500$ m$^3$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $500$ m$^3 = 500 \\times 1000 = 500\\,000$ L.", "", "\\emph{3.} $500\\,000 \\div 50\\,000 = 10$ 小时。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:11}", "花园：$20^2 = 400$ m$^2$。池塘：$\\pi \\times 3^2 = 9\\pi$ m$^2$。", "草地：$400 - 9\\pi \\approx 400 - 28.3 \\approx 372$ m$^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g6:measure:12}", "\\emph{1.} 小条：$15 \\times 6 \\times 1 = 90$ cm$^3$。大条：", "$30 \\times 12 \\times 2 = 720$ cm$^3$。体积变为原来的", "$720 \\div 90 = 8$ 倍 --- 三个尺寸各加倍，体积就变为原来的", "$2 \\times 2 \\times 2 = 8$ 倍。", "", "\\emph{2.} 巧克力的量是八倍，价钱只是四倍：是的，", "大条每克的性价比是小条的两倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g6:measure:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $1 \\times 9$：周长 $2 \\times (1 + 9) = 20$ m，", "面积 $9$ m$^2$。\\ $2 \\times 8$：周长 $2 \\times 10 = 20$ m，", "面积 $16$ m$^2$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 周长是（长 $+$ 宽）的两倍", "（见\\cref{ex:g6:measure:perimeter}），因此长 $+$ 宽", "$= 20 \\div 2 = 10$ m。列表如下：", "\\begin{center}", "\\renewcommand{\\arraystretch}{1.2}", "\\begin{tabular}{c|ccccc}", "围栏 & $1 \\times 9$ & $2 \\times 8$ & $3 \\times 7$ & $4 \\times 6$", "& $5 \\times 5$ \\\\", "\\hline", "面积（m$^2$） & $9$ & $16$ & $21$ & $24$ & $25$ \\\\", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "正方形 $5 \\times 5$ 最好。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $4.5 \\times 5.5 = 24.75$ 与 $4.9 \\times 5.1 =", "24.99$：越来越接近 $25$，但始终小于它。猜想：", "正方形胜过周长为 $20$ 的\\emph{每一个}长方形，", "包括边长为小数的情形。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 由表可知：和为", "$10$ 的两个数的积，在两数\\emph{相等}时最大（$5$ 和", "$5$）。一般地，和固定时，积在两部分", "相等时最大 --- 两部分越不相等，", "积就越小。", ""]}